# "Abilities that trigger when a creature dies won't trigger": Bot2's Haywire Mite ("When this creature dies, you gain 2 life") is bolted with
# Vren in play. It is exiled instead of dying (CR 700.4), so Bot2 gains no life and stays at 20, and the exile still counts for one Rat at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Vren, the Relentless
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Haywire Mite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Vren, the Relentless.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Haywire Mite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Haywire Mite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Haywire Mite
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Haywire Mite
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Power = 2
